## Original Content
Sony Music U.S. Latin’s GM Esteban Geller talks about the song’s continued success, even one month after the end of the World Cup.

## Summary
Shakira and Burna Boy's song 'Dai Dai' maintains its dominance on global charts a month after the World Cup ended. Sony Music U.S. Latin's GM, Esteban Geller, discusses the song's enduring success. The song's prolonged chart presence highlights its broad appeal beyond the initial World Cup hype.

